---
import { PREMIUM_REASONS } from '../consts';
---

<section id="why-premium" class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 py-20" aria-labelledby="premium-heading">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
    <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[2px] text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 rounded-2xl mb-4">PREMIUM ASSET</div>
    <h2 id="premium-heading" class="section-header tracking-tighter">Why Joyacrypto.com<br />commands a <span class="jewel-text">high acquisition price</span></h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-400">This is more than a domain — it is a ready-made luxury brand for the digital age.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    {PREMIUM_REASONS.map((reason) => (
      <article class="reveal premium-card bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 rounded-3xl p-7">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-400/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class={`fa-solid ${reason.icon} text-2xl text-emerald-400`}></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl tracking-tight mb-2 text-white">{reason.title}</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-zinc-400">{reason.description}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12 text-center text-base text-zinc-400 border-t border-zinc-800 pt-8">
    In a market where premium keyword and emotionally resonant .com domains in crypto and emerging tech regularly transact at significant valuations, Joyacrypto.com stands out as a rare, ownable luxury digital asset with both immediate brand power and lasting strategic value.
    <p class="mt-4">
      <a href="#faq" class="text-emerald-400 underline hover:text-emerald-300" data-track="cta-premium-faq">How is a premium domain valued? →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
